nd="01:23.260">She top my dope</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.590" end="01:24.090">Bitch want neck but my watch is gold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.830" end="01:25.330">I got a depressant</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.670" end="01:26.170">I do not fold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.760" end="01:27.260">She say that she hot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.350" end="01:27.850">I tell her I'm cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.130" end="01:28.630">She said that she want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.750" end="01:29.250">I tell her she old</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.540" end="01:30.040">Now nigga you not</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.300" end="01:30.800">But you say old</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.460" end="01:31.960">Choppa gon' spray</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.770" end="01:33.310">Ice in my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.310" end="01:34.810">You wanna run it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.480" end="01:36.650">I keep it with it so we let it bang</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.650" end="01:38.210">Can't mess with no lames</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.210" end="01:39.830">Got ice in my veins</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.830" end="01:42.710">They see me get big we're fuckin' asleep now big as a weight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.710" end="01:44.370">800k</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.370" end="01:46.090">My homie like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.090" end="01:49.290">I throwin' money then keep it 100 that bag is an A</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.290" end="01:50.790">Gimme the cash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.090" end="01:52.420">Gimme the racks I want it today</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.420" end="01:55.730">They wanted this and I wanted that don't care 'bout no fame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.730" end="01:59.730" /></div></body></tt>